meta {
  name: Start assigned GitHub issue timer
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/time-entries/timer/start-from-github
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "githubRepo": "{{githubOrganizationLogin}}/{{githubRepositoryName}}",
    "issueNumber": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Requires a verified workspace installation and an existing project mapping. Ordinary members must be explicitly assigned, including on public projects. Personal GitHub connection is not required.

  Optional githubProjectId is a verifiable board hint. Client titles, workspace IDs, credentials and assignment fields are rejected.

  Safe denial codes: project_assignment_required (403), github_installation_required (409), github_installation_unavailable (403), github_installation_permissions_required (403), github_organization_not_allowed (403), github_resource_unavailable (404), github_project_mapping_required / github_project_mapping_ambiguous (409), github_provider_unavailable (503). A denial creates no project, assignment, task or time entry. Existing owned timers can still be stopped.
}
